---
// Before/after diagram for the email-ingestion example. Dashed boxes are the parts the
// review removed. Colors come from the site theme, so it follows light and dark mode.
import './diagram.css'
---

<figure class="flow">
  <p class="state"><strong>Before</strong> state in 4 places, dashed ones were removed</p>
  <svg viewBox="9.5 15 590.5 215" role="img" aria-label="Before: state is kept in four places. A worker fetches mail from the inbox since a cursor, the place where the last poll stopped. It stores each email twice, in an emails table and in a messages table that support sees, and copies stuck mail to a review table behind an admin API, only for debugging. The emails table, cursor, review table and admin API were removed in the review.">
    <defs>
      <marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
        <path class="head" d="M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 z"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <path class="edge" d="M98 40 H246" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></path>
    <text class="note" x="172" y="32">fetch since cursor</text>
    <path class="edge" d="M264 56 V104 H212" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></path>
    <path class="edge" d="M328 40 H364" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></path>
    <path class="edge" d="M346 40 V172"></path>
    <path class="edge" d="M346 104 H364" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></path>
    <path class="edge" d="M346 172 H364" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></path>
    <path class="edge" d="M480 172 H502" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></path>

    <rect class="box" x="10" y="24" width="88" height="32" rx="4"></rect>
    <text x="54" y="44">inbox</text>
    <rect class="box" x="248" y="24" width="80" height="32" rx="4"></rect>
    <text x="288" y="44">worker</text>

    <rect class="box gone" x="130" y="88" width="80" height="32" rx="4"></rect>
    <text x="170" y="108">cursor</text>
    <circle class="badge" cx="210" cy="88" r="7"></circle><text class="badge-n" x="210" y="91.5">3</text>
    <text class="note" x="170" y="136">where the last</text>
    <text class="note" x="170" y="151">poll stopped</text>

    <rect class="box gone" x="366" y="24" width="114" height="32" rx="4"></rect>
    <text x="423" y="44">emails table</text>
    <circle class="badge" cx="480" cy="24" r="7"></circle><text class="badge-n" x="480" y="27.5">1</text>
    <text class="note start" x="490" y="44">copy 1</text>

    <rect class="box" x="366" y="88" width="136" height="32" rx="4"></rect>
    <text x="434" y="108">messages table</text>
    <circle class="badge" cx="502" cy="88" r="7"></circle><text class="badge-n" x="502" y="91.5">2</text>
    <text class="note start" x="366" y="136">copy 2, what support sees</text>

    <rect class="box gone" x="366" y="156" width="114" height="32" rx="4"></rect>
    <text x="423" y="176">review table</text>
    <circle class="badge" cx="480" cy="156" r="7"></circle><text class="badge-n" x="480" y="159.5">4</text>
    <rect class="box gone" x="504" y="156" width="86" height="32" rx="4"></rect>
    <text x="547" y="176">admin API</text>
    <text class="note" x="423" y="204">stuck mail,</text>
    <text class="note" x="423" y="219">for debugging</text>
    <text class="note" x="547" y="204">built only</text>
    <text class="note" x="547" y="219">to view it</text>
  </svg>

  <p class="state after"><strong>After</strong> state in 1 place, plus labels in the inbox</p>
  <svg viewBox="9.5 15 590.5 155" role="img" aria-label="After: state is kept in one place, the messages table, plus labels in the inbox that already existed. The worker fetches only unlabelled mail, stores each email once in the messages table, then labels the email in the inbox as ingested, unresolved or failed. Stuck mail, labelled unresolved or failed, stays visible in the inbox for debugging.">
    <path class="edge" d="M98 40 H246" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></path>
    <text class="note" x="172" y="32">fetch unlabelled</text>
    <path class="edge" d="M328 40 H364" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></path>
    <path class="edge" d="M288 56 V104 H54 V58" marker-end="url(#arrow)"></path>
    <text class="note" x="171" y="98">label each email</text>
    <text class="note" x="171" y="122">ingested · unresolved · failed</text>

    <rect class="box" x="10" y="24" width="88" height="32" rx="4"></rect>
    <text x="54" y="44">inbox</text>
    <rect class="box" x="248" y="24" width="80" height="32" rx="4"></rect>
    <text x="288" y="44">worker</text>
    <rect class="box kept" x="366" y="24" width="136" height="32" rx="4"></rect>
    <text x="434" y="44">messages table</text>
    <circle class="badge" cx="502" cy="24" r="7"></circle><text class="badge-n" x="502" y="27.5">1</text>
    <text class="note" x="434" y="72">stored once</text>

    <text class="note start" x="10" y="160">
      stuck mail (unresolved, failed) stays in the inbox for debugging
    </text>
  </svg>
</figure>

